{"id": 1007676, "slug": "rusty-rangers", "name": "Rusty Rangers", "name_original": "Rusty Rangers", "description": "<p>No one remembers what the world looked like before, except for a team of brave rangers. Now chaos and unpredictability reign everywhere - harmless creatures in the past bring destruction, and the world around is constantly changing, over and over again nullifying the familiar environment around.</p><h3>COMBINATION OF CLASSIC GAMEPLAY AND MODERN MECHANICS</h3><p>Take control of one of the brave rangers and go on a responsible mission - find the villains, stop the widespread madness and return peace and justice to the world!</p><p>You will meet many unique opponents that will keep you busy: run, jump and shoot to save the world! Each ranger has their own fighting style and special skills, so you can choose the hero that best suits you!</p><h3>BEAUTIFUL PIXEL GRAPHICS</h3><p>The universe of Rusty Rangers is full of detailed worlds, original and colorful characters, useful items and bizarre creatures. Each pixel is made with great love. Enjoy the beautiful and incredible world of Rusty Rangers!</p><h3>STORY QUESTS AND CHARACTERS</h3><p>Follow the story of Rusty Rangers and find out what really happened and how to fix it. With each new passage you will learn more about this world and its inhabitants. Chat with characters, complete their tasks, and get help in the fight against the cruel baron!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-28T06:15:14", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/7cb/7cbe5d0a0a7a22a0762291614b6ddf39.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/d84/d84eb6bb304b2d219c726a94c09c34d9.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 1, "added_by_status": {"dropped": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, 