ou busy: run, jump and shoot to save the world! Each ranger has their own fighting style and special skills, so you can choose the hero that best suits you!BEAUTIFUL PIXEL GRAPHICSThe universe of Rusty Rangers is full of detailed worlds, original and colorful characters, useful items and bizarre creatures. Each pixel is made with great love. Enjoy the beautiful and incredible world of Rusty Rangers!STORY QUESTS AND CHARACTERSFollow the story of Rusty Rangers and find out what really happened and how to fix it. With each new passage you will learn more about this world and its inhabitants. Chat with characters, complete their tasks, and get help in the fight against the cruel baron!"}